  "id": "esp32-h2-devkit-n4",
  "name": "ESP32-H2-DEV-KIT-N4 (Waveshare)",
  "chip": "Esp32H2",
  "description": "Waveshare ESP32-H2 devkit (ESP32-H2-DevKitM-1 pin layout): BLE 5 + 802.15.4 RISC-V chip, no Wi-Fi. CH343 UART and CH334 USB hub share one USB-C port.",
  "width_mm": 25.4,
  "height_mm": 52.3,
  "notes": [
    "BLE + 802.15.4 only - this chip has no Wi-Fi radio.",
    "Onboard addressable RGB LED on GPIO8 (WS2812 protocol - not a plain GPIO LED).",
    "UART0 (GPIO23/24) is wired to the onboard CH343; leave TX/RX unwired when using USB.",
    "GPIO13/GPIO14 connect to the 32.768 kHz crystal footprint; treat them as unavailable.",
    "GPIO26/27 carry native USB D-/D+.",
    "ADC1 channels 0-4 sit on GPIO1-5."
  ],
